{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a8bfd6ff81fb390b9229c4421a65ce2d801b7172fa63141db0a38bf0d7cafdee", "ja": "ざっ、ぱ～ん！　……ぷは～っ！\n……うん♪　イメージトレーニングはバッチリ！", "zh": "哗、哗——！……噗哈——！\n……嗯♪ 想象训练完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d5b6df7ee52b4c9c4fd84b744c86df76b757b69f8cc0997503fc808d09e9c892", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です！\nイメージトレーニング？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了！\n想象训练？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "374d75b49b2765b9c615e131612b6ff7fc69096d4d76f266a00ccd2f88f2a228", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です！\nえっと、綺麗な海に潜る練習をちょっと……えへへっ。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n那个，我只是在稍微练习潜入美丽的大海……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "69641e20c8271ef49d5c136f55a65ec6bb6d8ecce81a59240b475524e13550d6", "ja": "この前、話してた映画のロケ地を調べてたんですけど、\n魚がたくさん釣れる穴場スポットがあるみたいです！", "zh": "我刚才在查之前聊到的那部电影的取景地，\n听说那里还有个能钓到很多鱼的秘密地点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "03c0a261b6fe7dc1ef0a1e977f88cc58c63ffb70acda348fee8a50654d711671", "ja": "そうなんですか？　さすが青羽さん、詳しいですね！\nあとで、その場所を教えてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "这样啊？不愧是青羽小姐，您真了解呢！\n待会儿可以告诉我那个地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "600e9c8c6a1c81bac07c92344134eb284ae94a7b42a3f4e9f0cfcde3cfdceb70", "ja": "はい、もちろんです♪　そうだ！\n一緒に、オススメの釣り道具も教えちゃいますね！", "zh": "好的，当然可以♪对了！\n到时候我也一起告诉你推荐的钓鱼工具吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1136033d868ad9cd22d90257a3418d17782a20eba84d64c8582569fac6658036", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\nじゃあ、時間があったら釣りをしてみようかな。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你。\n那有时间的话，我就试着去钓鱼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "0856312246262efbd0508bc11f7b1b14bdb575e187e5451e83ae4c80d7fbcad2", "ja": "はい！　お仕事の合間に、楽しんでくださいね♪\n……ああ！　社長さんからお電話があったんでした！", "zh": "好的！请在工作间隙好好享受钓鱼的乐趣吧♪\n……啊！社长刚才打电话过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "9d497d81a593b519e04a8f956b5be83523fe70c9d3896e7386a25397b013f7b7", "ja": "例の、あのお話みたいですよ。", "zh": "好像就是之前提到的那件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "04ca18a5fd8740a2c8005dbe7e9e54172b5b7236c0a86479b2c6bf8ce0ec0370", "ja": "あの話についてか……！　わかりました。\n事務所に行ってくるので、留守をお願いします！", "zh": "是那件事啊……！我知道了。\n我现在去一趟事务所，这里就拜托你看店了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "9e56694deb934c8d7a9961d5006d1f0088b6b3f0a1607e99aae355c275e1069f", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃーい♪\n……私も、釣り道具、調べておこうっと！", "zh": "好——路上小心♪  \n……我也先查查钓鱼用具吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1012_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c97a863d582e1c874db0dbcc6ac506edda7e1beaa1eca1dd611dc8ee4748d8b2", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさ……。", "zh": "社长，音无女士，辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "ca036085314fe3cf6ae102c714721862ac8c6fcaecbacc97164cb9cfe6c12f3f", "ja": "おかしいです、社長！　サバイバルは命懸けなんです！\nそれなのに……私は、再考を要求します！", "zh": "不对啊，社长！生存挑战可是赌上性命的！\n即便如此……我要求重新考虑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "e32f1a3f27643dffceb3623719adbbcdceb22327e8eca438d4d9b83322f9ea43", "ja": "そ、そうかね？　ううむ……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "39e0252260c48d0ae9ad09137ff15e9e82858fd3fa6599031c7cfa4720ffd7dd", "ja": "えっと……お疲れ様です、社長、音無さん。", "zh": "那个……辛苦了，社长、音无小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "9b5b0968dfaa3d0c617aeb56dfe065af1c00700c6fe9d8f2cbd04147de976dc6", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！\nちょうどいいところに！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n您来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "8d1e384b586ddae4651247b3aaf19bab4e00272c6d0410bf518e2d5e6bf61fe5", "ja": "無人島でサバイバルする動画を見てたんです。\nそれがとっても面白くて……。", "zh": "我刚才在看无人岛求生的视频。\n真的特别有意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "c7889de02745dd1b437cadf757423fa3c5a24409c07130ff2d1d33d17a8391d2", "ja": "それで、もし自分が無人島でサバイバルするなら、\n何を持っていこうかって話になったんですけど……。", "zh": "于是，我们聊到如果自己要在无人岛上求生，该带些什么去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "58ec2c42b0d756a37c0e7399f511b60c3394c365917448088b91c2828a7db1cf", "ja": "私ならビーチチェアを持っていって、日焼けを\n楽しむと言ったら、おかしいと言われてしまってね。", "zh": "要是我说要带上沙滩椅，享受晒黑的乐趣，结果却被说很奇怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "f6ed0fc9a02226fbe43f0a043fa184395cd05bd2de7e16688adf4886d27aa0a3", "ja": "当然じゃないですか！　日焼けなんて……。\nサバイバル生活を何だと思ってるんですか？", "zh": "这不是理所当然的嘛！晒黑什么的……\n您以为野外求生生活是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "77f24aca7a359d03b3fe6381d47e7ed475696061377637ee9bd0fa1bf5cd2b2b", "ja": "わざわざ焼かなくても、日焼けしそうですしね……\n音無さんは、何を持っていこうと思っているんですか？", "zh": "就算不去刻意晒，感觉也会被晒黑呢……\n音无女士打算带什么去呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "1c7dfe0aa40d3ca9eeeb350e34282f3d2034a4c095104ae5ce64031fc0f06283", "ja": "私は、スマホを持っていこうと思ってます！\nポチッと押せば、お取り寄せもできちゃいますし♪", "zh": "我打算带上手机！\n只要轻轻一点，就能订购东西送过来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "79049d2030efe49fb9b5e281073a891fb474e70f6d724c5cad83891bb6b0a3d5", "ja": "それはズルくないかね、音無君！？", "zh": "这不算耍赖吗，音无！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "ee9ad2cfdce66f648af7da59cd4096c075ac78690836e58315e7054391984f41", "ja": "社長……私たちは、文明の利器から離れられない体に\nなってしまったんです！　現実を受け入れましょう！", "zh": "社长……我们已经离不开这些现代文明的工具了！接受现实吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b2a0695e43b29af242bc65132cff1f99a1d7843e0dfeaaeb49b731ab8af7ec01", "ja": "スマホもいいかもしれませんね。\nただ電波が届かなかったり、充電がなくなったら……。", "zh": "智能手机或许也不错。\n不过，要是收不到信号，或者没电了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "5183b5c117f6ef05d07ccc53ab2ccc21c1170b23462ce51e0c5ca2782357abd2", "ja": "はっ……電波！？　充電！！？　そ、そうでした！\n大事な事を、すっかり忘れてました……！", "zh": "哈……信号！？充电！！？对、对哦！我把重要的事情彻底忘了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "1d46e1634075f239ea7630724a83b63c33e4ffbbee029ae37baa0df3cfaacbe9", "ja": "ちなみに君だったら、無人島に何を持っていくかね？", "zh": "顺便问一下，要是你的话，会带什么去无人岛呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4b81a7c11671f7f6e2953fd3727625d7cfd2ae73a280264156a1e5d0989f8388", "ja": "無人島に持っていくものですか……結構迷うな。\nいえ、それより社長！　お話があると聞いたのですが。", "zh": "要带去无人岛的东西吗……还真是难以决定啊。\n不，先不说这个，社长！听说您有事要谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "9d96f78128c750bfc3bbb4fc4cba4217f0ad48640b9eaaed13eeed7c1467f48e", "ja": "おお、そうだった！　アイドル諸君がオーディションを\n受けた映画、『誰ソ彼ノ淵』の結果が届いたんだよ。", "zh": "哦，对了！各位偶像参加试镜的电影《誰ソ彼ノ淵》，结果通知送到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a0a5dc8c1768c8e7ffdcc92dfa8aaf13ebf98f87e35ed0d7feff6ab7c5b3f89e", "ja": "やっぱり……\nそろそろ結果が出る頃だと思ってました！", "zh": "果然……\n我就猜到差不多该出结果了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "cea96b5033bbc4f3d2d664b6d2abc2b0faf1c7045237f821bccac3785d20d45f", "ja": "うむ、それでは結果を発表しよう！\nオーディションの結果……。", "zh": "嗯，那么就来公布结果吧！\n试镜的结果是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "0a4b454f8647dcdc2db2b692cc582606ae8f32f23038a5fe737dfa50a33815e7", "ja": "出演者は、野々原茜君、島原エレナ君、北沢志保君。\n二階堂千鶴君、桜守歌織君の5名に決まった。", "zh": "出演者确定为野野原茜、岛原艾琳娜、北泽志保。\n二阶堂千鹤、樱守歌织，共5人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "0b77cd0041b37cc94cf628214a202bb401a799d4914f86ca7729494a2c3011e2", "ja": "それから、秋月律子君と水瀬伊織君も、\n脇を固めるメンバーにキャスティングされたよ。", "zh": "另外，秋月律子和水濑伊织也被选为负责助阵的成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "1242efc3676a5e73f523f17b3c8a9618fd82c6703e6068aeb1cd6d1a890be199", "ja": "遠方のロケ地での撮影は、勝手が違う事も多いだろう。\nだが君なら、アイドル達と乗り越えていけるはずだ！", "zh": "在远方的外景地拍摄，应该会有很多和平时不同、不太顺手的地方吧。\n不过，如果是你的话，一定能和偶像们一起克服困难的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
